# scripts/dedupe_rollup_transcripts.py's run artifacts: the dry run's
# findings (large -- it carries a before/after excerpt per affected page)
# and the resume state. Both are point-in-time records of one operator's
# run against production, not repo content.
scripts/rollup_dedupe_report.json
scripts/rollup_dedupe_state.json
# Same reasoning, for scripts/repair_seam_duplication.py and
