# scripts/score_gov_signals.py's cached raw HTML of real, external
# government pages (WO-105) -- the scored sheets/SUMMARY.md a scoring run
# writes under the same reports/gov_signals_scoring_<date>/ directory are
# committed like every other reports/*_scoring_<date>/ run; the raw page
# bodies themselves never should be (large, and a point-in-time copy of
# someone else's site content, not repo content).
reports/gov_signals_scoring_*/html_cache/
